	<Item Name="title" Type="String">The gene expression profiles of gallbladder cancer</Item>
	<Item Name="summary" Type="String">Gallbladder cancer is a rare but highly malignant cancer. We performed the transcriptional profile sequencing to figure out the potential mechanisms, which might significantly affect gallbladder cancer progression.</Item>
